{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"創世記","commonName":"創世記","title":"創世記","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"c386c509bcaf2d2e415b454ca78f5cfd89495b0f945d3896fb5dab5baca206b4","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["洪水消退"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["上帝記念挪亞和挪亞方舟裏的一切走獸牲畜。上帝叫風吹地，水勢漸落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["淵源和天上的窗戶都閉塞了，天上的大雨也止住了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["水從地上漸退。過了一百五十天，水就漸消。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["七月十七日，方舟停在亞拉臘山上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["水又漸消，到十月初一日，山頂都現出來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["過了四十天，挪亞開了方舟的窗戶，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["放出一隻烏鴉去；那烏鴉飛來飛去，直到地上的水都乾了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他又放出一隻鴿子去，要看看水從地上退了沒有。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但遍地上都是水，鴿子找不着落腳之地，就回到方舟挪亞那裏，挪亞伸手把鴿子接進方舟來。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他又等了七天，再把鴿子從方舟放出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["到了晚上，鴿子回到他那裏，嘴裏叼着一個新擰下來的橄欖葉子，挪亞就知道地上的水退了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他又等了七天，放出鴿子去，鴿子就不再回來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["到挪亞六百零一歲，正月初一日，地上的水都乾了。挪亞撤去方舟的蓋觀看，便見地面上乾了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["到了二月二十七日，地就都乾了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["上帝對挪亞說："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["「你和你的妻子、兒子、兒婦都可以出方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["在你那裏凡有血肉的活物，就是飛鳥、牲畜，和一切爬在地上的昆蟲，都要帶出來，叫牠在地上多多滋生，大大興旺。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["於是挪亞和他的妻子、兒子、兒婦都出來了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["一切走獸、昆蟲、飛鳥，和地上所有的動物，各從其類，也都出了方舟。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["挪亞獻祭"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["挪亞為耶和華築了一座壇，拿各類潔淨的牲畜、飛鳥獻在壇上為燔祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和華聞那馨香之氣，就心裏說：「我不再因人的緣故咒詛地（人從小時心裏懷着惡念），也不再按着我才行的滅各種的活物了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["地還存留的時候，稼穡、寒暑、冬夏、晝夜就永不停息了。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/GEN/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}